# Pass "cce": Chinese Comprehensive Expansion beside this mod, and nothing else optional.
#
# ninedaylongbow.ChineseComprehensiveExpansion, Workshop 3221850511, supports 1.5 and 1.6. Its own hard
# dependency is Harmony, already staged for this mod; VanillaExpanded.VFECore is only in its loadAfter
# (order, not a requirement), so it loads without it. This pass plays 17-chinese-comprehensive-expansion,
# which checks this mod loads after it and that nothing the two define collides.
#
# The item is a Windows subscription (1.6 folder present, checked 2026-09-28), and staging reads the
# Windows Workshop folder first, so nothing has to be downloaded into the WSL cache.
#
# ORDER. The staging does not sort by loadAfter: it activates the mods named here, in this order, and then
# the mod under test would land last of all if left unnamed, same as any player's own load order once
# loadAfter is honoured. This mod's own loadAfter names ninedaylongbow.ChineseComprehensiveExpansion, so it
# must load first; naming this mod's own packageId with a path: overlay after it puts it at that position
# and makes the staging skip its own copy of it (first run named this mod first instead and failed exactly
# on the ordering assertion: request fbc7, 2026-09-28).
ninedaylongbow.ChineseComprehensiveExpansion   3221850511
nelim.ancientchinesebeastandgeneexpanded   path:AncientChineseBeastAndGeneExpandedRenew/Mod
